OL,3,GNEWSAPolice ordered to attend inquest
OL,4,Ainto young mother's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner ordered a senior police
OL,7,Fofficer to attend the latest inquest
OL,8,Fhearing into the unexplained death of a
OL,9,Fyoung mother, after becoming frustrated
OL,10,Fby a lack of information.
OL,12,FThe body of 21-year-old Natasha Jade
OL,13,FAshby, known as Tasha, was found in
OL,14,FAugust 2023 in a tent at Hereford
OL,15,Fcounty bus station.
OL,17,FA post-mortem examination showed she
OL,18,Fhad died of a heroin overdose, but
OL,19,Ftoxicology tests showed she was not a
OL,20,Fregular user of the drug.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
